{
  "changelog": "**Major refactor and documentation overhaul for improved structure, tooling, and maintainability.**\n\n- Split large helper scripts into modular files under `addin/tools/_capture_helpers` for better organization and code reuse.\n- Refactored and relocated developer and tool scripts (e.g., moved from `tools/` and `scripts/` to `dev/` and `addin/tools/`).\n- Migrated and expanded documentation to the `docs/` directory; previous woodworking docs removed or moved.\n- Updated planning and modeling references in SKILL.md to match new doc structure (`docs/` instead of `woodworking/`).\n- Added several new developer utilities for mesh and texture processing (`dev/textures/`, `dev/woodgrain/`).\n- Numerous example models updated for compatibility with the refactored tools and new best practices.",
